  "summary": "Malicious code in filipt (PyPI)",
  "details": "\n---\n_-= Per source details. Do not edit below this line.=-_\n\n## Source: kam193 (71274850343391005d2d9594031bd612ad45b58389feeb4e416481d3c8b5e3e2)\nThe package ships a malicious executable started during the building of a wheel/installation. It has been identified as malicious by multiple vendors.\n\n\n---\n\nCategory: MALICIOUS - The campaign has clearly malicious intent, like infostealers.\n\n\nCampaign: 2026-11-filipt\n\n\nReasons (based on the campaign):\n\n\n - The package overrides the install command in setup.py to execute malicious code during installation.\n\n\n - malware\n\n\n - rat\n",
